<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: lion pelt -->
  <AEXP_Leather_Lion.label>獅子皮</AEXP_Leather_Lion.label>
  <!-- EN: A strong, luxurious leather of the leader of the animal kingdom. Often sought after by urbworld philanthropists. -->
  <AEXP_Leather_Lion.description>百獸之王堅韌且奢華的皮，很受都市世界慈善家們的喜愛。</AEXP_Leather_Lion.description>
  <AEXP_Leather_Lion.stuffProps.stuffAdjective>獅子皮</AEXP_Leather_Lion.stuffProps.stuffAdjective>
  
  <!-- EN: platypus leather -->
  <AEXP_Leather_Platypus.label>鴨嘴獸皮</AEXP_Leather_Platypus.label>
  <!-- EN: Platypus fur was considered a valuable commodity in the days of old Terra, a fact that almost drove the Platypus to extinction. Luckily, the animal was protected and thrived again. -->
  <AEXP_Leather_Platypus.description>鴨嘴獸通身長滿柔軟的皮毛，像一層上好的防水衣。因為其皮毛的良好性能，它們被人類大量捕殺，面臨著滅絕的危機。已被列入保護動物。</AEXP_Leather_Platypus.description>
  <AEXP_Leather_Platypus.stuffProps.stuffAdjective>鴨嘴獸皮</AEXP_Leather_Platypus.stuffProps.stuffAdjective>
  
  <!-- EN: wildebeest pelt -->
  <AEXP_Leather_Wildebeest.label>牛羚皮</AEXP_Leather_Wildebeest.label>
  <!-- EN: A thick but crumbly wildebeest fur and leather. Whilst it provides some degree of damage protection, the overall longevity of the item decreases. -->
  <AEXP_Leather_Wildebeest.description>這種皮毛雖然厚，但比較脆。雖然能提供一定防護效果，但使用壽命相對短。</AEXP_Leather_Wildebeest.description>
  <AEXP_Leather_Wildebeest.stuffProps.stuffAdjective>牛羚皮</AEXP_Leather_Wildebeest.stuffProps.stuffAdjective>
  
  <!-- EN: camel wool -->
  <WoolCamel.label>駱駝毛</WoolCamel.label>
  <!-- EN: Camel's wool. It provides good insulation from heat. -->
  <WoolCamel.description>駱駝的毛。隔熱能力出色。</WoolCamel.description>
  
</LanguageData>